# tvty's interface, in English: the reference. The other languages have
# the same files, with the same ids; `tvty i18n` measures them.
# What a ticket is, as fields: shared by the ticket panel and the new
# ticket (src/ui/fields.rs, src/composer.rs, src/ui/ticket_text.rs).

## aiball's values, said (aiball still gets its own)

fields-intent-request = request
fields-intent-question = question
fields-intent-fyi = fyi
fields-intent-feature = feature
fields-intent-panic = panic
fields-priority-urgent = urgent
fields-priority-high = high
fields-priority-normal = normal
fields-priority-low = low
fields-level-task = task
fields-level-milestone = milestone
fields-level-roadmap = roadmap
fields-scope-internal = internal
fields-scope-default = default
fields-scope-broadcast = broadcast

## Under the scope

fields-scope-note-internal = notifies nobody but who is mentioned
fields-scope-note-broadcast = notifies the project's followers too
fields-scope-note-default = notifies the ticket's subscribers and the project's owners

## Writing

fields-take-out = take it out
fields-write = Write
fields-preview = Preview
fields-title = Title
fields-body = What it is about… (@ to mention, ctrl+v pastes an image)
